{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Swarmer Survivors</strong> is a mind-bending physics-based arcade shooter survivorslite where you control a very fast jelly that can use mechanically rich weapons that combo with each other and the environment and mutate in an eldritch petri dish. Created in an unorthodox custom engine with assetless graphics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jelly can manually dash in the direction of movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The jelly attacks automatically when close to enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick unique upgrades after every level to spin out of control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finishing runs unlocks strong mutations that you can use to remix the gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Touch the Rock for extra damage, but don't touch enemies!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >42 unique superpower upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >21 mutations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 mechanically rich weapons + 1 permanent Rock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 biomes in 10 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mind-bending high quality VFX and SFX for an immersive experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A swarm simulation</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Hypermutator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1265010/fc50a5147b0e862dd3968a492f3c97947415be67.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1265010?t=1761995847","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265010/cff50aed0cf55d325764ec474e2e08dba1a09e64/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761995847","capsule_image"